{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "```python\ndef change_base(x: int, base: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Converts an integer x to its string representation in the given base.\n    Raises ValueError if base is not between 2 and 9 (inclusive).\"\"\"\n    if not (2 <= base <= 9):\n        raise ValueError(\"Base must be an integer between 2 and 9 (inclusive).\")\n\n    if x == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n\n    digits = []\n    current_x = x\n    while current_x > 0:\n        remainder = current_x % base\n        digits.append(str(remainder))\n        current_x //= base\n\n    return \"\".join(digits[::-1])\n```"}
